@startuml UC-08
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-08.md
title UC-08: View Profile
footer Feature PROF-01 | Business rules: BR-02, BR-08
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Customer" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "ProfileController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "ProfileService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

U -> MVC : Open profile page
MVC -> API : GET /api/profile (Bearer token)
API -> SVC : GetProfileAsync(currentUserId)
SVC -> DB : Select FullName, Email, Phone, Gender,\nDateOfBirth, AvatarUrl of current user (BR-08)
note right of SVC : PasswordHash and tokens are\nnever selected (BR-02)
DB --> SVC : Profile row
SVC --> API : ProfileDto
API --> MVC : 200 OK
MVC --> U : Show profile

@enduml
